# 2) Replace [YOUR-PASSWORD] with the REAL postgres password you set when
#    creating the project (Supabase never shows it again — reset it if lost).
# 3) Paste the full URI here and run:  bun run db:switch:postgres  (see docs/SUPABASE.md)
